## Model card

- **Name:** MAI-Thinking-1
- **Short description:** Microsoft AI’s MAI-Thinking-1 is described as an in-house ~1T/35B-active reasoning MoE (256K context) for hard reasoning and code; closed with no published public API id or rate card.
- **Provider / access:** Microsoft AI. Local metadata lists `microsoft/mai-thinking-1`, `noFreeId`, and notes no public token pricing.
- **Release / knowledge:** Official Microsoft AI model page reviewed 2026-11-10. Knowledge cutoff not explicitly stated in accessible reviewed content.
- **IDs:** `mai-thinking-1`, `MAI-Thinking-1`.
- **Context window:** 256,000 tokens (256K); max output 25,000 (local metadata).
- **Modalities:** Text input/output.
- **Pricing (as of 2026-11-10):** No public rate card/token price published (metadata).
- **Architecture:** Proprietary closed model (~1T/35B-active MoE per metadata); details not fully disclosed in accessible reviewed content.

